---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../../components/Navbar.astro';
import PageShell from '../../components/PageShell.astro';
---

<Layout 
    title="Terms & Conditions | Real BMI"
    description="Review the official terms and conditions for using Real BMI, our free browser-based health calculators, educational reference tools, and wellness resources."
    canonicalURL="https://realbmicalculator.com/en/terms-conditions/"
>
    <Navbar />
    <PageShell
        title="Terms & Conditions"
        eyebrow="Professional Standards & Legal Terms"
        description="Review the terms of use for Real BMI’s calculators, health tools, and privacy-forward experience."
        returnUrl="/en/"
        returnLabel="Home"
    >
        <div class="prose prose-zinc dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-[var(--muted-foreground)] leading-relaxed space-y-8 text-base sm:text-lg font-medium opacity-90">
            <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-normal text-[var(--foreground)] leading-relaxed">
                These Terms and Conditions set the rules for using Real BMI. This platform includes all our free health calculators, body charts, and learning guides.
            </p>
            <p>
                By visiting or using this website, you agree to follow these rules. If you do not agree with these terms, please stop using our site right away.
            </p>

            <!-- 1. Educational Scope & Non-Diagnostic Purpose -->
            <div class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
                    1. Educational Scope &amp; Non-Diagnostic Purpose
                </h2>
                <p>All health calculators on Real BMI are built for learning and personal awareness only. They help you check your body numbers at home.</p>
                <p>Under no condition should these scores be taken as medical advice. They are not medical tests or clinical checks. Only a doctor can diagnose health conditions. Real BMI is not a clinic or hospital.</p>
                <p>Always talk with your doctor before you start a new diet or a hard workout plan.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- 2. Scientific Formulas & Calculation Accuracy -->
            <div class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
                    2. Scientific Formulas &amp; Calculation Accuracy
                </h2>
                <p>Real BMI uses trusted math formulas from global health groups. These include rules from the World Health Organization and the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention. We also use formulas from top scientists like Mifflin-St Jeor, Devine, and Mosteller.</p>
                <p>Even so, these formulas use group averages. They cannot see your exact bone mass, muscle size, or daily water weight.</p>
                <p>For example, athletes with dense muscle may see a high BMI score even with low body fat. Older adults may lose muscle with age, which can hide body fat under a normal score. Our scores are helpful guides, not clinical truths.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- 3. Local Browser Processing & Data Privacy -->
            <div class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
                    3. Local Browser Processing &amp; Data Privacy
                </h2>
                <p>We protect your private health data at all times. Real BMI runs on a privacy-first model. When you enter your height, weight, age, and waist size, all math runs inside your web browser.</p>
                <p>We never send your health numbers to our servers. We never save, sell, or share your numbers with anyone. When you close your browser tab, your numbers are gone right away.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- 4. Permitted Personal Use & User Conduct -->
            <div class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
                    4. Permitted Personal Use &amp; User Conduct
                </h2>
                <p>You get a free personal license to use Real BMI for your own learning. You may not use this site for commercial gain. You agree not to harm the site or break its code.</p>
                <p>Prohibited actions include:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>You must not use automated bots or scrapers to copy our math or text.</li>
                    <li>You must not try to attack our servers or slow down our network.</li>
                    <li>You must not put our tools inside other commercial apps without written consent.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- 5. Intellectual Property Rights -->
            <div class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
                    5. Intellectual Property Rights
                </h2>
                <p>All software code, visual styles, 3D body models, and health guides on Real BMI belong to software engineer Bhawanshi Dosi. They are protected by global copyright laws.</p>
                <p>You may check your numbers for personal health awareness. But you may not copy, change, or sell our code or articles without written permission from the creator.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- 6. Disclaimer of Warranties -->
            <div class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
                    6. Disclaimer of Warranties
                </h2>
                <p>Real BMI and all its health tools are offered on an 'as-is' and 'as-available' basis. We make no promises of any kind.</p>
                <p>We do not promise that the site will always run without small delays or bugs. We do not promise that these tools will meet every personal fitness goal you set.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- 7. Limitation of Liability -->
            <div class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
                    7. Limitation of Liability
                </h2>
                <p>To the fullest extent allowed by law, Real BMI and its founder Bhawanshi Dosi are not liable for any harm or losses tied to your use of this site.</p>
                <p>This includes decisions you make about diet, fitness, or weight based on our scores. If you are not happy with our site, your only step is to stop using it.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- 8. Third-Party Citations & Digital Ads -->
            <div class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
                    8. Third-Party Citations &amp; Digital Ads
                </h2>
                <p>Our guides link to trusted papers from groups like the WHO, CDC, and NIH. We also show clean ads through Google AdSense to fund our 23 free health tools.</p>
                <p>We do not run or own those outside sites. We are not responsible for what they post or sell. When you click outside links, you do so at your own risk.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- 9. User Indemnification -->
            <div class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
                    9. User Indemnification
                </h2>
                <p>You agree to defend and protect Real BMI and its operators from any claims or costs that arise if you break these rules or misuse our site.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- 10. Severability & Entire Agreement -->
            <div class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
                    10. Severability &amp; Entire Agreement
                </h2>
                <p>If a court finds any part of these terms invalid, all other parts remain in full force.</p>
                <p>These terms, along with our Privacy Policy and Cookie Policy, make up the full agreement between you and Real BMI.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- 11. Governing Law & Court Location -->
            <div class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
                    11. Governing Law &amp; Court Location
                </h2>
                <p>These terms follow the laws of India. Any legal dispute tied to this site must be handled by the courts in Banswara, Rajasthan, India.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- 12. Changes to These Terms -->
            <div class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
                    12. Changes to These Terms
                </h2>
                <p>We may update these terms from time to time as our site grows. We will post the new date at the top of this page. If you keep using the site after updates, you accept the new rules.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- 13. Pre-Publication Review & Quality Checks -->
            <div class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
                    13. Pre-Publication Review &amp; Quality Checks
                </h2>
                <p>All 23 health calculators and articles pass four strict quality checks before they go live:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>First, we check all math against WHO and CDC papers.</li>
                    <li>Second, we run over 920 unit tests to check metric and imperial units.</li>
                    <li>Third, we check that no personal data or names are ever stored or shown.</li>
                    <li>Fourth, we test site speed, easy reading, and clean mobile layouts.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- 14. Creator Identity & Contact Details -->
            <div class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
                    14. Creator Identity &amp; Contact Details
                </h2>
                <p>Real BMI is an independent software project made and run by Bhawanshi Dosi in Banswara, Rajasthan, India.</p>
                <p>If you have questions about these terms, please write to us at support@realbmicalculator.com or visit our <a href="/en/contact/" class="text-[var(--accent)] underline font-medium">contact page</a>.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- 15. Data Privacy Commitment & No Sale of User Data -->
            <div class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
                    15. Data Privacy Commitment &amp; No Sale of User Data
                </h2>
                <p>Real BMI stands firmly against selling user data. We do not sell, rent, or trade your data to any data brokers or ad firms.</p>
                <p>All math stays in your local device memory. We keep zero user accounts and zero health profiles on our servers.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- 16. Web Accessibility & Multi-Device Support -->
            <div class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
                    16. Web Accessibility &amp; Multi-Device Support
                </h2>
                <p>We build our tools to work fast and smooth on every device. This includes mobile phones, tablets, and laptops.</p>
                <p>We follow web accessibility rules so screen readers can easily read our text. Our colors have strong contrast for easy reading.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- 17. Continuous Updates & User Feedback -->
            <div class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
                    17. Continuous Updates &amp; User Feedback
                </h2>
                <p>We review our health tools every six months. When health groups release new data, we update our math right away.</p>
                <p>We welcome feedback and new research from readers and doctors. Every note helps us keep our tools accurate and helpful.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </PageShell>
</Layout>
